&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Meta for B2B retargeting and account-based targeting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience being held to CRM-sourced pipeline metrics, not platform conversions — comfortable in Salesforce and a BI tool like Tableau&lt;/li&gt;
