&lt;p&gt;Requirements:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS Degree or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years building and operating backend services in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in backend service design &amp;nbsp;defining service boundaries, contracts and data ownership, not only implementing within them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level fluency to read, write and speak in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll thrive as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Developer Productivity,&lt;/strong&gt; if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked inside a large, heavily-coupled codebase and found the seams: extracting or bypassing functionality incrementally, behind behaviour-preserving contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in TypeScript and Node, and comfortable with edge runtimes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have hands-on experience with monorepo tooling at scale (Nx, Turborepo or similar) and understand why build-graph correctness is a product concern rather than a config detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat migration work as engineering rather than chores: you budget for the parts that fail silently, verify generated output rather than trusting a green build, and know that bug-for-bug translation&amp;nbsp;beats improvement when the goal is proving nothing changed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy being a platform engineer with real customers — partnering with product teams, adapting the platform to how they actually work rather than requiring them to change, and measuring yourself on their adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working across cloud boundaries, with a considered view on where a workload belongs and what crossing between clouds costs in latency and spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate decisions in writing well enough that someone can pick up your work from the ticket — and are willing to say plainly when the fast answer and the right answer diverge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay curious and open to growth — demonstrating a proactive embrace of AI, and actively building and applying fluency in emerging technologies to elevate how we work, drive faster outcomes, and expand collective impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
