&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with — or the technical aptitude to quickly learn — core concepts and tools related to front-end web development (including programming languages such as HTML, CSS, React, and JavaScript), APIs, hosting and infrastructure, Enterprise Architecture, CRO and digital marketing, SEO, UX and UI design, and security&lt;/li&gt;
